<title>UK: SmithKline sinks tracking drop in ADRs.</title>
<headline>SmithKline sinks tracking drop in ADRs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in SmithKline Beecham Plc sank on Friday, tracking a 2.5 percent drop in the company's ADRs overnight, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0810 GMT, SmithKline shares were down 11p, or 1.2 percent, to 908-1/2p.</p>
<p>Zeneca Group Plc shares, meanwhile, were down 1-1/2p to 1748-1/2p, after its ADRs slipped by a fraction. Shares in Glaxo Wellcome Plc were flat at 1133-1/2p as its ADRs were unchanged. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
